WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.920 --> 00:07.592
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.656 --> 00:14.683
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.268 --> 00:21.940
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.965 --> 00:28.179
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
This surging power...

00:29.073 --> 00:34.745
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.073 --> 00:31.160
Black Jack

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.247 --> 00:42.502
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.296 --> 00:48.258
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.829 --> 00:57.184
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.685 --> 00:59.376
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.376 --> 01:01.369
will be there

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
It makes me glad...

01:01.389 --> 01:04.349
yokatta

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
That I found my place here.

01:04.594 --> 01:12.074
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.127 --> 01:13.645
Oh WISDOM

01:13.645 --> 01:15.494
will be there

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
I searched for the reason

01:15.522 --> 01:18.163
sagashita

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.164 --> 01:25.212
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
as long as we're alive.

01:25.797 --> 01:32.677
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.678 --> 01:34.763
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.847 --> 01:37.031
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.183 --> 01:39.794
His name is Black Jack.

02:02.446 --> 02:03.560
The mailman's here!

02:04.854 --> 02:08.306
I'll be checking any mail from women.

02:08.393 --> 02:08.780
Alright.

02:10.830 --> 02:12.896
Dr. Black Jack

02:11.277 --> 02:12.945
A pink envelope...

02:14.614 --> 02:17.408
It must be an invitation to a wedding.

02:17.409 --> 02:18.867
A wedding?

02:25.125 --> 02:26.716
He's getting married, huh?

02:27.460 --> 02:29.442
He's your friend?

02:29.838 --> 02:31.422
No, just a classmate from med school.

02:31.486 --> 02:32.692
"Adress" "Name"  "Not Attending" "Attending"

02:32.793 --> 02:34.989
Why aren't we attending?

02:35.213 --> 02:37.258
I don't like these sorts of occasions.

02:37.413 --> 02:38.464
You must!

02:38.972 --> 02:40.180
Give it back to me, Pinoco.

02:40.181 --> 02:41.724
You must go.

02:41.725 --> 02:45.519
You don't have many friends so you
must cherish those you have.

02:45.520 --> 02:46.478
Hey!

02:47.670 --> 02:49.017
Also...

02:49.524 --> 02:50.681
A guest?!

02:50.900 --> 02:53.008
A guest would be your spouse.

02:53.278 --> 02:56.322
And your spouse is me!

02:56.451 --> 02:59.299
Attending: Pinoco, Doc

03:01.188 --> 03:04.330
Originally "Misdiagnoses" by Tezuka Osamu

03:01.188 --> 03:04.330
The Misdiagnoses of His Life

03:04.398 --> 03:08.618
Futohara Hospital

03:15.925 --> 03:17.634
There goes the head doctor.

03:17.635 --> 03:20.346
He's the second one in the hospital,
but I heard he's quite good.

03:21.514 --> 03:23.182
Time for check-ups by the head doctor.

03:28.270 --> 03:29.270
Let's see...

03:29.356 --> 03:33.400
Doctor, I have bad chest pain.

03:33.401 --> 03:35.986
You'll get well if we continue the treatment..

03:35.987 --> 03:38.947
Thank you so much.

03:44.222 --> 03:44.865
Doctor.

03:45.182 --> 03:47.539
Doctor, about that patient...

03:47.609 --> 03:50.459
She's not gotten any better in two weeks.

03:51.945 --> 03:54.046
Should we switch to a chemical therapy?

03:54.047 --> 03:57.549
Did you forget that she has kidney problems?

03:57.589 --> 03:58.402
But...

03:58.426 --> 04:00.636
What if it causes an infection?!

04:00.637 --> 04:01.178
Idiot.

04:01.471 --> 04:03.764
Then some other treatment may...

04:05.266 --> 04:06.892
The current one is fine!

04:06.935 --> 04:10.604
I don't know how good you are, but don't
talk to me like you know better!

04:10.605 --> 04:11.897
Right, sorry.

04:11.898 --> 04:14.608
Dr. Futohara, you have a call on line one.

04:16.277 --> 04:18.195
That'd be the senator.

04:18.697 --> 04:20.531
Doctor, there are more check-ups...

04:20.532 --> 04:22.449
I'm busy!

04:22.450 --> 04:23.867
You do the rest!

04:23.868 --> 04:26.435
Follow my instructions exactly!

04:26.746 --> 04:27.809
Jeez.

04:32.127 --> 04:34.253
A round of golf?

04:34.254 --> 04:36.422
I'd be happy to come.

04:36.969 --> 04:39.633
And please don’t forget about the election deal.

04:41.636 --> 04:42.803
I'll talk to you then.

04:43.276 --> 04:44.027
Come in.

04:44.806 --> 04:46.223
Excuse me.

04:49.751 --> 04:51.228
Here is your mail.

04:51.250 --> 04:52.803
Dr. Futohara Yasuo

04:53.898 --> 04:55.941
Here is your schedule for today.

04:55.942 --> 04:59.028
You have a meeting with
a pharmaceutical company at three.

04:59.029 --> 05:01.030
And an interview with a medical magazine at five.

05:01.031 --> 05:04.491
The dinner with the medical group is at six.

05:10.915 --> 05:13.834
A wedding invitation, huh.

05:14.065 --> 05:15.313
Who is it from?

05:15.628 --> 05:17.129
It's my classmate from med school.

05:17.130 --> 05:20.549
I should pay my classmates a visit.

05:22.177 --> 05:24.323
Fit this in my schedule.

05:24.637 --> 05:25.929
Yes, sir.

05:32.562 --> 05:33.896
Man, I'm busy.

05:33.897 --> 05:36.289
I don't even have time to eat.

05:49.329 --> 05:50.868
I should go home.

06:11.154 --> 06:13.203
Ito! is that you?

06:14.143 --> 06:14.932
It's me!

06:15.292 --> 06:16.292
Remember?

06:16.489 --> 06:17.886
Tachibana-senpai.

06:18.530 --> 06:19.877
Sign: Yakitori

06:21.223 --> 06:22.945
Futohara Hospital, huh?

06:22.946 --> 06:26.657
I hear that the second head doctor
is doing well with his hospital.

06:26.815 --> 06:31.620
Reducing the number of doctors and increasing
the inpatient count will do that.

06:31.621 --> 06:32.656
Is that so?

06:33.957 --> 06:37.418
He hasn't operated much himself, and
he keeps telling me what to do.

06:37.633 --> 06:41.565
And all I do is treat the patients
exactly as he says—like a robot.

06:42.924 --> 06:46.260
I'm starting to lose my passion as a doctor.

06:46.411 --> 06:48.364
Sounds like you have it pretty rough.

06:48.596 --> 06:51.732
Oh well. If it gets too tough, then just leave.

06:51.975 --> 06:56.895
But even if I go elsewhere, all I can do is...

06:57.188 --> 06:59.064
Cheer up.

06:59.107 --> 07:01.619
You can come talk to me anytime.

07:22.756 --> 07:27.232
They'll have lots of delicious food at the wedding!

07:27.969 --> 07:29.470
Pinoco, you ready?

07:29.688 --> 07:31.429
Aye-aye!

07:42.954 --> 07:43.954
Come in.

07:44.903 --> 07:46.195
Excuse me.

07:47.888 --> 07:50.366
Doctor, about that patient earlier...

07:50.367 --> 07:52.618
The one with appendicitis?

07:52.619 --> 07:55.079
She's still getting the antibiotic IV, right?

07:55.080 --> 07:55.808
Yes.

07:56.341 --> 07:59.416
That level of appendicitis should be treated with antibiotics.

07:59.508 --> 08:01.285
No need to operate.

08:01.884 --> 08:06.799
But Doctor, is his case really appendicitis?

08:06.800 --> 08:07.424
What?!

08:08.259 --> 08:09.823
I-I'm sorry!

08:10.053 --> 08:13.013
It's Just that he has acute pains and
also throws up occasionally.

08:13.014 --> 08:16.100
Are you criticizing my diagnosis?!

08:16.327 --> 08:18.185
No, I don't mean to.

08:18.186 --> 08:21.188
Both are symptoms of appendicitis!

08:21.189 --> 08:24.525
The appendix gets infected periodically!

08:24.526 --> 08:26.402
It's just another case of appendicitis!

08:26.403 --> 08:27.236
Got it?!

08:27.237 --> 08:30.614
Intravenous injection of antibiotics
will cure him in no time!

08:30.756 --> 08:31.503
Right...

08:31.556 --> 08:32.569
Jeez.

08:32.867 --> 08:35.285
Oh, I need to get going.

08:35.745 --> 08:38.872
Don't act on your own while I'm gone.

08:39.196 --> 08:40.186
Right.

09:02.063 --> 09:03.981
Upsy-daisy!

09:03.982 --> 09:06.066
Oh, it looks delicious!

09:07.902 --> 09:10.863
Pinoco, do you want me to ask for a high-chair?

09:11.732 --> 09:14.074
I'm a grown-up!

09:14.075 --> 09:16.827
l'm not using a kid's chair!

09:17.078 --> 09:19.788
Man, I'm so late.

09:21.923 --> 09:22.923
Well, hello!

09:23.056 --> 09:24.416
Long time no see.

09:27.289 --> 09:28.416
Black Jack.

09:29.443 --> 09:30.709
I don't see you around much.

09:31.003 --> 09:32.043
Dr. Futohara.

09:32.414 --> 09:34.386
So, how are you doing?

09:34.781 --> 09:37.070
Anyway, I'm starving!

09:37.461 --> 09:39.330
It looks good.

09:41.895 --> 09:45.272
I heard that your license was revoked.

09:45.328 --> 09:45.875
Yeah.

09:46.008 --> 09:47.755
And you have your office?

09:48.035 --> 09:48.588
Yeah.

09:49.338 --> 09:50.761
Be careful.

09:50.831 --> 09:52.738
What if they catch you?

09:54.911 --> 09:56.302
It's not just about you.

09:56.326 --> 09:58.869
Getting caught will bring shame on all of your classmates.

09:58.870 --> 09:59.745
Right?

10:01.286 --> 10:04.251
Hey! You got something to say?!

10:04.459 --> 10:05.626
Stop it, Pinoco.

10:05.627 --> 10:07.002
But...

10:07.003 --> 10:10.901
Anyway, life sure has changed a lot for all of us.

10:11.591 --> 10:14.802
There are some that are head doctors
of a major hospital like me,

10:14.803 --> 10:17.549
and there are some who're practicing unlicensed.

10:17.847 --> 10:18.918
Unlicensed?

10:19.012 --> 10:19.712
Is he serious?

10:24.020 --> 10:28.527
And I heard that you made some company
president pay ¥100,000,000.

10:28.775 --> 10:33.570
It's people like you that tarnish the image of doctors.

10:36.241 --> 10:38.184
Shame on you.

10:40.588 --> 10:42.287
Doc!

10:42.288 --> 10:43.872
Don't mind him, Pinoco.

10:43.873 --> 10:44.999
But!

10:47.064 --> 10:53.298
And now a word from the groom’s friend
from medical school, Dr. Futohara.

10:51.199 --> 10:52.559
Bring me a drink!

10:56.720 --> 11:01.901
I'd like to say congratulations on behalf of our class.

11:02.225 --> 11:04.778
He's so rude!

11:04.912 --> 11:05.973
Unforgivable!

11:06.062 --> 11:07.646
Let me go!

11:13.278 --> 11:16.530
Dr. Ito, that patient with appendicitis is having trouble!

11:29.085 --> 11:33.589
The Futohara Hospital that I manage earns a considerable profit.

11:33.590 --> 11:37.092
And we return a portion of it back to the community.

11:37.093 --> 11:43.057
We doctors must contribute to the
greater cause of the community...

11:49.584 --> 11:50.511
It hurts!

11:50.557 --> 11:51.300
Help!

11:52.504 --> 11:53.884
What should I do...

11:54.157 --> 11:54.962
Any sedatives?

11:55.227 --> 11:56.320
It's not working.

11:59.282 --> 12:00.991
Call the head doctor right away!

12:00.992 --> 12:04.453
I tried earlier, but it just goes to his voice mail.

12:06.331 --> 12:10.793
In fact, doctors are supposed to...

12:10.794 --> 12:13.857
I don't know how to eat this.

12:15.619 --> 12:16.763
It's salty.

12:17.346 --> 12:20.094
He just keeps talking about himself.

12:20.095 --> 12:24.890
When I run for the Diet please vote for me.

12:29.487 --> 12:31.287
<i>I just can't believe it's appendicitis.</i>

12:31.523 --> 12:33.584
<i>Should I make an incision?</i>

12:33.900 --> 12:36.902
<i>But it'll be a real problem if anything goes wrong.</i>

12:38.738 --> 12:40.239
Is this City Hospital?

12:40.240 --> 12:41.824
Please patch me over to Dr. Tachibana.

12:44.369 --> 12:46.577
But I can't tell from your description alone.

12:46.746 --> 12:49.331
Sorry, but I'm in the middle of seeing a patient.

12:49.400 --> 12:50.958
Call again later.

12:51.584 --> 12:52.649
Senpai!

12:53.503 --> 12:55.276
What do I do now?

12:56.302 --> 12:57.274
I can't help it.

12:57.298 --> 12:59.252
I must see him in person and talk to him.

13:05.599 --> 13:08.017
Doctor, please come back to the patient is room.

13:08.018 --> 13:09.101
The patient is...

13:09.102 --> 13:10.154
Huh?

13:10.779 --> 13:11.812
Doctor?

13:12.193 --> 13:13.029
Doctor?

13:19.404 --> 13:21.112
To City Hospital.

13:21.435 --> 13:22.042
OK.

13:33.251 --> 13:35.753
Congratulations on your marriage.

13:35.754 --> 13:37.171
Can I shake your hand?

13:38.048 --> 13:40.062
Yes, thank you so much.

13:40.235 --> 13:42.728
You are so beautiful.

13:42.835 --> 13:44.803
You are very adorable too.

13:47.054 --> 13:48.599
Thank you for coming.

13:48.850 --> 13:52.227
I was afraid that you wouldn't come.

13:52.359 --> 13:54.188
I wasn't going to originally.

13:58.803 --> 13:59.703
What's the matter?

14:00.436 --> 14:01.275
Doc,

14:02.836 --> 14:05.866
Are you upset that I forced you to come?

14:06.368 --> 14:07.057
No.

14:07.517 --> 14:09.185
I'm actually grateful.

14:11.688 --> 14:12.745
What?!

14:12.898 --> 14:15.316
The condition of the appendicitis patient worsened?!

14:15.317 --> 14:17.527
Why didn't you call me earlier?!

14:17.778 --> 14:18.736
What?

14:18.737 --> 14:19.904
It went to voice mail?

14:19.905 --> 14:20.857
I see.

14:20.927 --> 14:21.994
Idiot!

14:22.282 --> 14:25.409
Yes, he's writhing with cyanosis.

14:25.410 --> 14:27.787
We gave him a sedative but it hasn't worked!

14:27.874 --> 14:30.027
Dr. Ito should know!

14:30.261 --> 14:32.410
But he went missing.

14:32.879 --> 14:34.335
W-What?!

14:34.336 --> 14:36.003
How irresponsible!

14:36.004 --> 14:37.922
Find him right now and bring him back!

14:38.215 --> 14:39.048
Ouch!

14:39.049 --> 14:39.924
Ouch! Ouch!

14:39.925 --> 14:41.926
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

14:41.927 --> 14:43.385
We're trying right now!

14:43.386 --> 14:45.346
Don't we have any other doctors?!

14:45.347 --> 14:47.181
Only doctors of internal medicine are around.

14:47.182 --> 14:48.974
Please return immediately!

14:48.975 --> 14:50.476
The patient is in critical condition!

14:52.687 --> 14:54.146
Man...

14:54.147 --> 14:57.024
I have to do all the actual care.

15:01.571 --> 15:03.697
Black Jack!

15:03.698 --> 15:05.950
Hey, I want to ask you for a favor.

15:05.951 --> 15:08.001
Would you come to my hospital?

15:08.453 --> 15:11.747
I guess an appendicitis patient is in trouble.

15:11.748 --> 15:13.791
It may have caused peritonitis.

15:13.792 --> 15:16.836
We are short on staff, so can you
help me with an operation?

15:16.909 --> 15:18.691
I'll pay you well.

15:19.015 --> 15:20.215
Hey, excuse me!

15:21.133 --> 15:24.468
You badmouthed him, and now you want...

15:24.970 --> 15:26.731
Is that an official request?

15:28.849 --> 15:30.099
Y-Yeah.

15:30.418 --> 15:32.476
In that case, I'll do it

15:32.477 --> 15:33.574
for ¥30,000,000.

15:33.812 --> 15:36.147
¥30,000,000?!?!

15:36.148 --> 15:38.649
¥30,000,000 for an operation?

15:38.650 --> 15:40.568
You dare charge that to me, your classmate?!

15:40.860 --> 15:42.027
It's fine if you don't want to.

15:45.031 --> 15:47.116
O-OK!

15:47.117 --> 15:48.742
I'll pay.

15:48.743 --> 15:51.704
We'll be held responsible if we let
a patient die from appendicitis.

15:51.705 --> 15:52.496
I'll pay!

15:52.497 --> 15:53.664
I'll pay you!

15:54.161 --> 15:56.343
I accept your request, then.

16:02.340 --> 16:04.383
Doctor! Hurry!

16:04.676 --> 16:06.105
Don't rush me, idiot.

16:07.637 --> 16:09.180
It hurts!

16:09.422 --> 16:10.556
Help!

16:10.557 --> 16:13.225
The sedative didn't work?

16:13.226 --> 16:14.810
Not much at all.

16:16.229 --> 16:17.980
Does he really have appendicitis?

16:19.483 --> 16:21.927
This is neither appendicitis or peritonitis.

16:22.277 --> 16:24.219
It's probably an acute case of pancreatitis.

16:25.332 --> 16:27.530
I don't want to hear that from an unlicensed doctor!

16:27.783 --> 16:30.576
My diagnosis is never wrong!

16:30.577 --> 16:31.827
Prepare for an operation!

16:33.038 --> 16:34.924
I'm certain that it's pancreatitits.

16:35.251 --> 16:38.375
Black Jack, I'm his primary physician.

16:38.376 --> 16:40.419
So follow my orders!

16:41.705 --> 16:42.545
Anesthesia.

16:45.133 --> 16:48.302
Make the incision point at the lower right abdomen,
outer edge of the rectus abdominis.

16:48.303 --> 16:49.762
That's the wrong spot.

16:50.012 --> 16:52.223
No, this is the right spot.

16:52.252 --> 16:53.367
Don't argue with me.

16:53.391 --> 16:55.476
You only need to assist me!

17:06.530 --> 17:09.083
How many laparotomies have you performed?

17:09.644 --> 17:10.825
Shut up!

17:10.826 --> 17:12.201
Your hand is shaking.

17:13.411 --> 17:18.666
You let other Doctors perform operations
while you just sat around, didn't you?

17:18.868 --> 17:19.540
Shut up!

17:20.072 --> 17:22.503
Look, this is the spot.

17:22.548 --> 17:23.708
The lower end of the greater omentum.

17:23.902 --> 17:25.102
It's almost cured.

17:26.742 --> 17:27.395
Strange.

17:27.676 --> 17:29.760
Then, the left abdomen!

17:29.761 --> 17:31.804
We'll close this spot and cut the left abdomen.

17:32.806 --> 17:34.265
Doctor, but the bleeding...

17:34.624 --> 17:36.425
Infuse more blood.

17:40.397 --> 17:42.282
That spot is fine too.

17:44.109 --> 17:45.693
It can't be!

17:46.862 --> 17:48.362
So you did misdiagnose him.

17:48.756 --> 17:51.184
You cut open the wrong spots.

17:51.616 --> 17:53.745
Then where?!

17:53.869 --> 17:55.911
What does he have?!

17:56.040 --> 17:57.496
Doctor! Problem with his blood pressure!

18:00.333 --> 18:01.876
Leave the rest to me!

18:02.461 --> 18:03.088
Got it?!

18:04.212 --> 18:06.060
We are switching to an incision at the pancreas.

18:07.382 --> 18:08.716
<i>It can't be.</i>

18:08.717 --> 18:11.469
<i>His symptoms clearly were that of appendicitis.</i>

18:14.681 --> 18:16.891
Dr. Ito! Where have you been?!

18:16.892 --> 18:18.586
The patient was in danger because of you!

18:19.519 --> 18:21.353
The patient was in great pain,

18:21.354 --> 18:24.982
so I was getting advice from another doctor
on whether or not to operate on him!

18:24.983 --> 18:27.610
Which other doctor?!

18:27.611 --> 18:29.487
Why not me?!

18:29.780 --> 18:32.210
We couldn't get a hold of you!

18:32.532 --> 18:34.930
Aren't you going to help me?

18:36.912 --> 18:38.245
Do as you want.

18:38.246 --> 18:40.456
You diagnosed him with pancreatitis.

18:40.457 --> 18:41.957
You can operate on him.

18:41.958 --> 18:43.816
Pancreatitis?

18:44.044 --> 18:46.796
So it wasn't appendicitis after all.

18:46.797 --> 18:48.923
Just as I said!

18:48.924 --> 18:50.466
S-Shut up!

18:50.467 --> 18:51.949
Enough!

18:52.177 --> 18:53.641
Are you really doctors?!

18:54.805 --> 18:55.771
We are in a middle of an operation.

18:56.056 --> 18:57.431
Save the fighting for later.

19:00.823 --> 19:01.824
We are resuming the operation.

19:02.437 --> 19:03.670
Median incision of the upper abdomen.

19:08.193 --> 19:10.273
<i>He's so fast.</i>

19:10.862 --> 19:11.987
Here's his pancreas.

19:12.531 --> 19:14.069
Look how swollen it is.

19:14.282 --> 19:16.238
Couldn't you see it before?

19:21.289 --> 19:22.414
Electrocautery scalpel.

19:23.125 --> 19:23.967
<i>Amazing...</i>

19:24.167 --> 19:26.387
<i>He is a real surgeon.</i>

19:30.006 --> 19:30.842
Drainage.

19:35.303 --> 19:36.378
Operation completed.

19:47.607 --> 19:52.323
H-Hey Black Jack, do you want to work at my hospital?

19:52.612 --> 19:56.603
This hospital will be world-renowned if you are here.

19:56.825 --> 20:00.077
Have you forgotten that my license was revoked?

20:00.078 --> 20:02.288
Who do you think I am?

20:02.289 --> 20:05.082
I can get you that license back in no time at all.

20:05.309 --> 20:06.667
We can co-own it.

20:06.668 --> 20:08.544
We'll make hoards of money.

20:08.545 --> 20:10.212
Think about it.

20:10.464 --> 20:11.797
Absolutely not.

20:12.299 --> 20:14.057
Still no, huh...

20:15.469 --> 20:17.261
Here's the money, as promised.

20:31.655 --> 20:32.475
Doctor...

20:33.195 --> 20:35.613
You don't have to come in after tonight!

20:35.863 --> 20:36.902
Doctor!

20:37.115 --> 20:38.908
l don't even want to talk to you.

20:39.659 --> 20:42.958
You've never talked to me properly.

20:43.914 --> 20:46.540
I'd love to quit anyway!

20:59.304 --> 21:01.097
Doctor! Wait!

21:01.098 --> 21:03.599
Dr. Black Jack, please hire me.

21:03.850 --> 21:05.059
Let me be your apprentice.

21:05.141 --> 21:05.787
Please.

21:05.811 --> 21:08.062
I was greatly impressed by your operation.

21:08.063 --> 21:10.606
I want to learn your skill!

21:12.818 --> 21:14.743
You have a bright future ahead of you.

21:15.112 --> 21:17.029
Go to a reputable hospital.

21:17.030 --> 21:19.532
But I want to work under you.

21:19.533 --> 21:21.742
I want to be a surgeon like you!

21:22.140 --> 21:23.202
Absolutely not.

21:23.203 --> 21:23.994
Doctor!

21:23.995 --> 21:27.640
I won't partner with anyone, and need nobody's help.

21:33.207 --> 21:33.939
Go.

21:34.297 --> 21:37.049
And don't become a doctor like myself—

21:39.428 --> 21:42.096
One that anyone would look down on.

21:42.463 --> 21:44.169
Dr. Black Jack...

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.544 --> 22:17.550
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
Only look straight at me.

22:17.551 --> 22:24.723
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.768 --> 22:32.025
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.026 --> 22:42.535
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.536 --> 22:47.916
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.917 --> 22:57.300
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.917 --> 22:53.122
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.577 --> 22:57.301
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.301 --> 23:08.061
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.062 --> 23:13.149
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.150 --> 23:26.120
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.121 --> 23:33.044
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.045 --> 23:43.930
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.045 --> 23:36.978
sora no hate tooku

23:37.071 --> 23:43.871
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.054 --> 24:15.037
Shrinking!

23:45.281 --> 23:47.281
They all shrank and died!

23:47.327 --> 23:49.527
It's a type of atrophy.

23:49.661 --> 23:53.221
I found that it's a contagious case
where the bodies shrink.

23:53.347 --> 23:54.841
The bodies shrink?

23:55.294 --> 23:57.204
What is happening here?

23:57.459 --> 24:00.979
I am infected with the disease.

24:02.019 --> 24:03.132
Why are they shrinking?!

24:03.265 --> 24:04.844
Are you giving up already?

24:04.878 --> 24:08.453
You must know what to do next!

24:08.851 --> 24:11.198
Doc, good luck...

24:11.726 --> 24:13.817
Next Karte - Shrinking!

24:16.044 --> 24:17.716
Karte NG...

24:18.755 --> 24:20.297
30,000,000 pesos.

24:20.298 --> 24:22.299
30,000,000 pesos?!

24:22.354 --> 24:24.554
Oh, wow...
